# --- PATIENTER --- #
### Hele listen (patienter)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/patients

### Opret patient
POST http://localhost:3000/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{"cpr":"0201029994","navn":"Ny Test Person"}

### Uden body — skal give 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/patients

### Ukendt sti — skal give 404
GET http://localhost:3000/findesikke

# --- MEDICIN --- #

### Hele listen (medicin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/medicin

### Opret medicin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/medicin
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id":3,"navn":"Isotretinoin","dosis":"40 mg","tidspunkt":"17:00","interval_dage":1}

### Uden body — skal give 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/medicin

# --- REGISTRERING --- #

### Hele listen (registrering)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/registrering

### Opret registrering
POST http://localhost:3000/api/registrering
Content-Type: application/json

{"medicin_id":15,"taget":true}

# --- LOGIN --- #

### 1. Login uden password — skal give 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"brugernavn":"nancy"}

### 2. Login med forkert password — skal give 401
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"brugernavn":"nancy","password":"forkert"}

### 3. Login med korrekt password — skal give 200
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"brugernavn":"nancy","password":"hemmelig123"}

### 4. Hvem er jeg? — skal give 200 efter login
GET http://localhost:3000/api/me

### 5. Log ud — skal give 204
POST http://localhost:3000/api/logout

### 6. Hvem er jeg? — skal give 401 efter logout
GET http://localhost:3000/api/me
